45   5    *  *  *   curl --fail --max-time 120 -X POST -H "x-cron-secret: $CRON_SECRET" http://alphalog-pwa.internal:3000/api/cron/algorithms/paper-review
*    *    *  *  *   curl --fail --max-time 30  -X POST -H "x-cron-secret: $CRON_SECRET" http://alphalog-pwa.internal:3000/api/cron/algorithms/tradovate-poll
